      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Transcription**\n\nI've established the `poll_transcription.py` file. It's built around the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text client, leveraging `google.cloud.speech_v1p1beta1`. I've defined the critical `poll_transcription` function. Its structure is now firm.\n\n\n**Refining the Implementation**\n\nI've defined the core function, `poll_transcription_job`, which is key to the module's operation. It accepts an `operation_name` and iteratively checks the status of the transcription job until completion, then returns the extracted transcript. I've removed the example usage block to adhere to the design specifications. The integration with the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text client is now solidified.\n\n\n",
