    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on selecting a speech-to-text service for the `submit_transcription.py` script. Google Cloud Speech-to-Text seems like a good fit, so I'm leaning toward that provider. The code needs to clearly identify and interact with this specific service.\n\n\n**Defining the Code**\n\nI'm now creating `submit_transcription.py`. It'll use Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. The Python code will leverage the client library to submit the audio. I'm focusing on incorporating the audio URI and configuration details into the transcription request and including comments to identify the provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818511401,
          "start": 1789818508765
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
